{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15219300","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15219300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1521930001:0":{"text":"여기가 보칼리스예요? 아빠랑 엄마가 말해 준 거랑 조금 다르네요...","source_cn":"这里就是呼临城吗？和爸爸妈妈说的不太一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4DFAAD2FAA4E4A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521930002:0":{"text":"레이니, 무서워할 것 없단다. 내가 여기 있잖니.","source_cn":"蕾妮，不要怕。我在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A7282E05AE1F1EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521930003:1":{"text":"네... 낸시르 아줌마가 있으니까 전 하나도 안 무서워요!","source_cn":"嗯……有南茜阿姨在，我不怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3C4FB3D9BC0CF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1521930003":{"text":"네... 낸시르 아줌마가 있으니까 전 하나도 안 무서워요!","source_cn":"嗯……有南茜阿姨在，我不怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3C4FB3D9BC0CF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521930005:1":{"text":"내 목숨을 구해줘서... 정말로 고마워.","source_cn":"谢谢你们……谢谢你们救了我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE37F6CA1E4A307FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn